{"shot": "013", "role": "关咪", "text": "按你掌柜的话办。", "performance": "低沉沉稳，平声陈述；重心放在掌柜和办，末字收住，说完再将原井沿肉装入客咪篮。", "budget": "2.2—2.5秒；短停约0.5秒，后约3秒入篮，沿用6秒剪辑预算。", "parameters": {"voice_id": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural", "rate": "-10%", "pitch": "-10Hz", "volume": "+0%", "format": "mp3"}, "output": "剧集/EP001/制作成果/audio/配音/对白/SHOT-EP001-013_关咪_Edge_v001.mp3", "mode": "reuse", "source_audio": "剧集/EP001/制作成果/audio/配音/试听/关咪_Edge_v001.mp3", "source_run_id": "20261008T132133-ed89f911", "status": "succeeded", "bytes": 12240, "sha256": "b5a496c5eb3ab81b92088737325778dc93ed7e1dd427816cb9c21c8d4b1b57f1", "file_duration_seconds": 2.04, "decoded_duration_seconds": 2.04, "suggested_in_seconds": 0.19, "suggested_out_seconds": 1.48, "speech_window_seconds": 1.29, "measurement_method": "FFmpeg完整解码；10ms RMS -45dB门限；首尾各留30ms/100ms保护；保留句内停顿；未逐字回听", "edit_budget_seconds": 6, "original_non_speech_reserve_seconds": 3.5, "speech_plus_reserve_seconds": 4.79, "timing_status": "within_original_budget", "performance_status": "punctuation_and_base_prosody_only; emotional_performance_requires_review", "quality_verdict": "not_assessed"}
{"shot": "016", "role": "肉摊伙计", "text": "掌柜，就是他。", "performance": "急着报告但不尖叫；称呼后短停，后半句落向关咪，尾音短收，不添告状内容。", "budget": "1.6—1.8秒；余约0.7秒给落步，沿用2.5秒剪辑预算。", "parameters": {"voice_id": "zh-CN-YunxiaNeural", "rate": "+0%", "pitch": "+0Hz", "volume": "+0%", "format": "mp3"}, "output": "剧集/EP001/制作成果/audio/配音/对白/SHOT-EP001-016_肉摊伙计_Edge_v001.mp3", "mode": "generate", "job_id": "EP001-DIALOGUE-016-20261008-v001", "run_id": "20261008T133357-37855644", "status": "succeeded", "bytes": 14400, "sha256": "c38c159cb799d4cab31563bc2cc45d0b6a6e71615a9cd2b540f8871052593c82", "file_duration_seconds": 2.4, "decoded_duration_seconds": 2.4, "suggested_in_seconds": 0.18, "suggested_out_seconds": 1.64, "speech_window_seconds": 1.46, "measurement_method": "FFmpeg完整解码；10ms RMS -45dB门限；首尾各留30ms/100ms保护；保留句内停顿；未逐字回听", "edit_budget_seconds": 2.5, "original_non_speech_reserve_seconds": 0.7, "speech_plus_reserve_seconds": 2.16, "timing_status": "within_original_budget", "performance_status": "punctuation_and_base_prosody_only; emotional_performance_requires_review", "quality_verdict": "not_assessed"}
{"shot": "018", "role": "张咪", "text": "你卖的是豆，还是粉？", "performance": "浑厚声线带挑衅，前半句较平，转折处略停；粉字略重，句尾轻上挑，不添笑声。", "budget": "2.5—2.9秒；余约0.6秒给对视，沿用3.5秒剪辑预算。", "parameters": {"voice_id": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural", "rate": "+5%", "pitch": "-5Hz", "volume": "+0%", "format": "mp3"}, "output": "剧集/EP001/制作成果/audio/配音/对白/SHOT-EP001-018_张咪_Edge_v001.mp3", "mode": "reuse", "source_audio": "剧集/EP001/制作成果/audio/配音/试听/张咪_Edge_v001.mp3", "source_run_id": "20261008T132135-899e20f3", "status": "succeeded", "bytes": 17424, "sha256": "be8a75d5ef7c03205b83e348a0ca0ee0c243f5418989defd261734087d13a490", "file_duration_seconds": 2.904, "decoded_duration_seconds": 2.904, "suggested_in_seconds": 0.14, "suggested_out_seconds": 2.14, "speech_window_seconds": 2.0, "measurement_method": "FFmpeg完整解码；10ms RMS -45dB门限；首尾各留30ms/100ms保护；保留句内停顿；未逐字回听", "edit_budget_seconds": 3.5, "original_non_speech_reserve_seconds": 0.6, "speech_plus_reserve_seconds": 2.6, "timing_status": "within_original_budget", "performance_status": "punctuation_and_base_prosody_only; emotional_performance_requires_review", "quality_verdict": "not_assessed"}
{"shot": "019", "role": "关咪", "text": "你捏碎我的豆，还问我？", "performance": "压低声音质问，气息稳；捏碎和豆稍重，逗号处短停，问我收紧，不突然拔高为怒吼。", "budget": "2.8—3.2秒；余约0.8秒压声停顿，护袋与对白并行，沿用4秒剪辑预算。", "parameters": {"voice_id": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural", "rate": "-10%", "pitch": "-10Hz", "volume": "+0%", "format": "mp3"}, "output": "剧集/EP001/制作成果/audio/配音/对白/SHOT-EP001-019_关咪_Edge_v001.mp3", "mode": "generate", "job_id": "EP001-DIALOGUE-019-20261008-v001", "run_id": "20261008T133359-64a6e1fd", "status": "succeeded", "bytes": 16848, "sha256": "8ab5e5ae6a78b5f6e3207c86accf184f71919642e2f86bf0150d20bc874bcc51", "file_duration_seconds": 2.808, "decoded_duration_seconds": 2.808, "suggested_in_seconds": 0.2, "suggested_out_seconds": 2.22, "speech_window_seconds": 2.02, "measurement_method": "FFmpeg完整解码；10ms RMS -45dB门限；首尾各留30ms/100ms保护；保留句内停顿；未逐字回听", "edit_budget_seconds": 4, "original_non_speech_reserve_seconds": 0.8, "speech_plus_reserve_seconds": 2.82, "timing_status": "within_original_budget", "performance_status": "punctuation_and_base_prosody_only; emotional_performance_requires_review", "quality_verdict": "not_assessed"}
{"shot": "020", "role": "张咪", "text": "你分了我的肉，又怎么说？", "performance": "直截了当地追问；肉字重，转折处短停，后半句向关咪压过去，保持清楚字音。", "budget": "3.1—3.6秒；余约0.9秒给听者反应，沿用4.5秒剪辑预算。", "parameters": {"voice_id": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural", "rate": "+5%", "pitch": "-5Hz", "volume": "+0%", "format": "mp3"}, "output": "剧集/EP001/制作成果/audio/配音/对白/SHOT-EP001-020_张咪_Edge_v001.mp3", "mode": "generate", "job_id": "EP001-DIALOGUE-020-20261008-v001", "run_id": "20261008T133401-6a5fa8df", "status": "succeeded", "bytes": 17712, "sha256": "f67960c6ae8a47f6d763c41582d738e1edec0ea9a6ca395d661cc5d0b4aa0244", "file_duration_seconds": 2.952, "decoded_duration_seconds": 2.952, "suggested_in_seconds": 0.14, "suggested_out_seconds": 2.21, "speech_window_seconds": 2.07, "measurement_method": "FFmpeg完整解码；10ms RMS -45dB门限；首尾各留30ms/100ms保护；保留句内停顿；未逐字回听", "edit_budget_seconds": 4.5, "original_non_speech_reserve_seconds": 0.9, "speech_plus_reserve_seconds": 2.97, "timing_status": "within_original_budget", "performance_status": "punctuation_and_base_prosody_only; emotional_performance_requires_review", "quality_verdict": "not_assessed"}
